 "ばか": "أَحْمَق, غَبِيّ (A person of low general intelligence.)  [idiot]\nمثال: こんな荒れ模様の日に外出するなんて君は馬鹿だよ。\n→ You are an idiot to go out in this weather. / غَبِيّ (Without intelligence.) / غَبِيّ, أَحْمَق (A stupid person; a fool.)  [stupid]\nمثال: なんという馬鹿なことだろう。\n→ What a piece of folly! / تافِه (Ignorable; of little significance or value.)  [trivial] / معيب (Having one or more defects.) / نَاقِص (Having a root whose final consonant is weak (ي, و, or ء).)  [defective]",
