 "ばかし": "حَوَالَيْ, تَقْرِيبًا (Imprecise but close to in quantity or amount.)  [approximately] / وَحِيد (1. alone in a category) / فَقَط (Without others or anything further; exclusively.) / فَقَط (No more than; just.) / فَقَط (Introduces a clause with negative polarity, often one which upsets the listener')  [only] / عَدْل (Morally right; upright, righteous, equitable; fair.) / فَقَط (only, simply, merely)  [just (finished, etc.)]\nafter the -ta form of a verb",
