 "ばかず": "خِبْرَة, تَجْرِبَة (The effect upon the judgment or feelings produced by any event, whether witnesse) / اِخْتِبَار (An activity one has performed.) / خِبْرَة (A collection of events and/or activities from which an individual or group may g) / خِبْرَة, تَجْرِبَة (The knowledge thus gathered.)  [experiences]",
