 "ばんごう": "عَدَد, نمرة (An abstract entity used to describe quantity.) / عَدَد, رَقْم (A numeral: a symbol for a non-negative integer.) / عَدَد (An element of one of several sets: natural numbers, integers, rational numbers, ) / رَقْم (A sequence of digits and letters used to register people, automobiles, and vario) / رَقْم (A telephone number.) / رَقَّمَ (To label (items) with numbers; to assign numbers to (items).)  [number]\nمثال: ええ、じゃあ私の電話番号教えるね。\n→ OK. Let me give you my number.",
