 "ひき": "عُلْجُوم, ضِفْدَع طِين (An amphibian, a kind of frog (broad sense, order Anura) with shorter hindlegs an)  [toad (esp. the Japanese toad, Bufo japonicus)]\nمثال: カエルとヒキガエルの区別が出来ない。\n→ I can't distinguish a frog from a toad.",
