 "ひきあいにだす": "اِقْتِبَاس, اِسْتِشْهَاد (A statement attributed to a person; a quotation.) / عَلَامَة اِقْتِبَاس, عَلَامَة تَنْصِيص (A quotation mark.) / سَعَر (A summary of work to be done with a set price; a quotation.) / سِعْرُ ٱلْأَسْهُم (A price set and offered (by the potential seller) for a financial security or co) / اِسْتَشْهَدَ, اِقْتَبَسَ (To indicate verbally or by equivalent means the start of a quotation.)  [to quote]",
 "ひきあう": "دَفَعَ, خَلَّصَ (To give money or other compensation to in exchange for goods or services.) / معاش, أجر (Money given in return for work; salary or wages.)  [to pay]\nمثال: 長い目で見れば、正直は引き合う。\n→ Honesty pays in the long run. / [to pull against each other]",
 "ひきあけ": "فَجْر (To begin to brighten with daylight.) / فَجْر, فَلَق (The morning twilight period immediately before sunrise.) / شُرُوق (The rising of the sun.) / شُرُوق, مَشْرِق (The time when the sun rises.) / فَجْر (The earliest phase of something.)  [dawn]",
 "ひきあげ": "[pulling up ; drawing up] / رَفَعَ (to cause to rise)  [raising]\nمثال: 関税引き上げの提案国はお互いに反目しています。\n→ Proponents of increased import duties are at odds with each other. / إخْلَاء, تَخْلِيَة (The act of evacuating; leaving a place in an orderly fashion, especially for saf) / إخْلَاء (Withdrawal of troops or civils from a town, country, fortress, etc.) / تَفْرِيغ, تَخْلِيَة (The act of emptying, clearing of the contents, or discharging, including creatin)  [evacuation]",
 "ひきあげる": "رَفَعَ (To elevate to a higher position.)  [to lift up]\nمثال: 引き上げてくれ。\n→ Give me a hoist. / زَاد (To make (a quantity, etc.) larger.) / زِيَادَة (An amount by which a quantity is increased.) / اِرْتِفَاع, اِزْدِيَاد (For a quantity, the act or process of becoming larger.)  [to increase]\nمثال: 政府は近々、消費税を引き上げるつもりなのかしら。\n→ Will the government raise the consumption tax soon? / سَحَبَ (To extract (money) from a bank account or other financial deposit.) / تَرَاجَعَ (Chiefly followed by from: to leave a place, someone's presence, etc., to go to a)  [to withdraw]\nمثال: 彼は夕食後自室に引き上げた。\n→ He retired to his own room after supper. / رَقَّى (To raise (someone) to a more important, responsible, or remunerative job or rank) / رَوَّجَ (To advocate or urge on behalf of (something or someone); to attempt to populariz)  [to promote (someone to a higher position)]",
 "ひきあて": "رَهْن, رَهْن عَقَارِيّ (A legal agreement in which a borrower pledges real property as collateral for a )  [mortgage]",
 "ひきあてきん": "اِحْتِيَاط (that which is reserved or kept back, as for future use) / ذَخِيرَة (that which is reserved or kept back, as for future use) / حَجَزَ (To book in advance; to make a reservation for.)  [reserves]",
 "ひきあてる": "دَلَجَ, غَرَفَ (Senses relating to attracting.) / رَسَمَ (Senses relating to attracting.) / قُرْعَة (The act of drawing:)  [to draw (the winning ticket)] / وَضَعَ (To lay or place; to put (one thing to another)) / طَبَّقَ (To put to use; to use or employ for a particular purpose, or in a particular cas)  [to apply]",
