 "ひきいる": "رَصَاص (A heavy, pliable, inelastic metal element, having a bright, bluish color, but ea) / قَادَ (To guide or conduct.) / أَرْشَدَ, هَدَى (To guide or conduct.)  [to lead]\nمثال: しかし城にたどりつくなり、近衛兵を率いた人によって、わたしはこの牢獄に勾引されてしまった。\n→ However, when I finally reached the castle I was thrown into this prison by the commander of the imperial guard.",
 "ひきうけ": "قَامَ (To take upon oneself; to start, to embark on.)  [undertaking]\nمثال: 私はその重い責任を引き受けたくはない。\n→ I don't like to take on the heavy responsibilities.",
 "ひきうけにん": "كَافِل (A person, company, or organization that provides a guarantee.)  [guarantor]",
 "ひきうける": "قَامَ (To take upon oneself; to start, to embark on.)  [to undertake]\nمثال: その仕事を引き受けようかなと思っている。\n→ I'm wondering whether to take on that job. / وَرَثَ (to receive property or a title by legal succession etc.)  [to inherit] / ضَمَان, ضَمَانَة (Anything that assures a certain outcome.) / ضَمِنَ (To give an assurance that something will be done right.)  [to guarantee] / عَقْد, مُعَاهَدَة (An agreement which the law will enforce in some way. A legally binding contract ) / أَغْدَمَ, اِدَّغَمَ (To shorten by omitting a letter or letters or by reducing two or more vowels or )  [to contract (a disease)]",
