 "ひきうつる": "حَرُكَ, تَحَرَّكَ (To change place or posture; to go, in any manner, from one place or position to ) / اِنْتَقَلَ, تَحَلْحَلَ (To change residence, for example from one house, town, or state, to another; to )  [to move]",
 "ひきおこす": "قَضِيَّة (A goal, aim or principle, especially one which transcends purely selfish ends.) / سَبَّبَ (To set off an event or action; to bring about; to produce.)  [to cause]\nocc. written as 惹き起こす\nمثال: 彼の不注意な運転が事故を引き起こした。\n→ His careless driving caused the accident. / [to pull upright ; to help up (e.g. a fallen person)]",
