 "ひきたて": "مَعْرُوف (A kind or helpful deed; an instance of voluntarily assisting (someone).) / أَنْعَمَ (To look upon fondly; to prefer.)  [favor] / دَعَمَ, دَعَّمَ (To help keep from falling.) / أَيَّدَ, دَعَمَ (To back or favor a cause, party, etc., mentally or with concrete aid) / تَأْيِيد, دَعْم (Financial or other help.)  [support]",
