 "ひきつぐ": "وَرَثَ (to receive property or a title by legal succession etc.)  [to inherit]\nمثال: 私の息子が仕事を引き継ぐだろう。\n→ My son will take over the job. / سَلَّمَ (To relinquish control or possession of something to someone.)  [to hand over]",
 "ひきつける": "اِجْتَذَبَ, جَذَبَ (To pull toward without touching.)  [to attract (to oneself, e.g. with bait or light)]\nمثال: この磁鉄鉱は地球の磁場に引きつけられる。\n→ The magnetite is attracted to the earth's magnetic field. / اِجْتَذَبَ, جَذَبَ (To pull toward without touching.)  [to attract]\nمثال: そのサッカーの試合は大観衆を引き付けた。\n→ The soccer game attracted a large crowd. / [to have a convulsion ; to convulse]",
