 "ひっくい": "حَزين (Depressed in mood, dejected, sad.) / خافِت, مُنْخَفِض (Quiet; soft; not loud.)  [low (rank, degree, value, content, quality, etc.)]\nمثال: この机は私にはちょっと低い。\n→ This desk is a little low for me. / حَزين (Depressed in mood, dejected, sad.) / خافِت, مُنْخَفِض (Quiet; soft; not loud.)  [low (position)] / قَصِير, قصير (Having a small distance from one end or edge to another, either horizontally or ) / قَصِير (Having little duration.)  [short (height)] / عَمِيق, غَوِيط (Extending, reaching or positioned far from a point of reference, especially down)  [deep (voice)]",
