 "ひっくりかえす": "قَلَبَ (To flip over; to rotate uppermost to bottom.)  [to turn over]\nمثال: 彼はテーブルをひっくり返した。\n→ He turned the table upside down. / [to knock over ; to tip over] / مُسْتَاء, مُمْتَعِض (Angry, distressed, or unhappy) / إخْلَال (Disturbance or disruption.) / أَسْخَطَ (To make (a person) angry, distressed, or unhappy.) / أَخَلَّ (To disturb, disrupt or adversely alter (something).)  [to upset]",
