 "ひっけい": "[indispensable ; essential]\nمثال: TOEICの学習に限らず、英語を学ぶのであれば英和辞典は必携の書の一つでしょう。\n→ An English-Japanese dictionary is surely a must have book, not just for those taking TOEIC, but for all studying English. / دَلِيل, كُتَيِّب (A topically organized book of reference on a certain field of knowledge, regardl)  [handbook]\nusu. in book titles",
