 "ひっこむ": "غَطَسَ (To move or be moved into something.) / مَجْلَى, مَغْسَلَة (A basin used for holding water for washing.)  [to sink]\nمثال: 今までどこに引っこんでいたのですか。\n→ Where've you been keeping yourself? / [to be set back (e.g. from a road)] / سَحَبَ (To extract (money) from a bank account or other financial deposit.) / تَرَاجَعَ (Chiefly followed by from: to leave a place, someone's presence, etc., to go to a)  [to withdraw (e.g. from the public eye)]",
