 "ひっさげる": "[to carry in one's hand ; to have in one's hand] / رَصَاص (A heavy, pliable, inelastic metal element, having a bright, bluish color, but ea) / قَادَ (To guide or conduct.) / أَرْشَدَ, هَدَى (To guide or conduct.)  [to lead (e.g. troops)] / حَالِيّ, حَاضِر (Relating to now, for the time being; current.) / مَوْجُود, حَاضِر (Located in the immediate vicinity.) / الزَّمَان, الْحَال (The current moment or period of time.) / قَدَّمَ, طَرَحَ (To bring (someone) into the presence of (a person); to introduce formally.)  [to present (an issue, policy, artistic work, etc.)]",
