 "ひつぜつ": "وَصْف, تَوْصِيف (A sketch or account of anything in words; a portraiture or representation in lan)  [description]\nمثال: その風景は筆舌に尽くせないほど美しい。\n→ The scenery is beautiful beyond description.",
 "ひつぜん": "حَتْمِيّ (Impossible to avoid or prevent.)  [inevitable] / ضَرُورَة, حَاجَة (The quality or state of being necessary, unavoidable, or absolutely requisite.)  [necessity]",
 "ひつぜんせい": "ضَرُورَة, حَاجَة (The quality or state of being necessary, unavoidable, or absolutely requisite.)  [necessity]",
 "ひつぜんてき": "حَتْمِيّ (Impossible to avoid or prevent.)  [inevitable]\nمثال: それは必然的に延期しなければならない。\n→ It must, of necessity, be postponed.",
 "ひつび": "ضَرُورِيّ, لَازِم (Required, essential, whether logically inescapable or needed in order to achieve)  [necessary]",
 "ひつぼく": "قِرْطَاسِيَّة (Writing materials, envelopes, office materials.)  [stationery]",
 "ひつめい": "اِسْم مُسْتَعَار (A fictitious name (more literally, a false name), as those used by writers and m)  [pseudonym]",
 "ひつよう": "ضَرُورِيّ, لَازِم (Required, essential, whether logically inescapable or needed in order to achieve)  [necessary]\n必用 can imply has to be used rather than is just needed\nمثال: 私達が生きていくためには衣食住が必要です。\n→ We need food, clothes and a home in order to live. / ضَرُورَة, حَاجَة (The quality or state of being necessary, unavoidable, or absolutely requisite.)  [necessity]\nمثال: 歯医者に行く必要はないですよ。\n→ You don't need to go to the dentist's.",
 "ひつようじ": "ضَرُورَة, حَاجَة (The quality or state of being necessary, unavoidable, or absolutely requisite.)  [necessities]",
 "ひつようじょうけん": "شَرْط ضَرُورِيّ (A statement Q in relation to statement P such that P implies Q.)  [necessary condition]\nمثال: この仕事はわれわれの必要条件を満たしていない。\n→ This work does not meet our requirements.",
 "ひつようせい": "ضَرُورَة, حَاجَة (The quality or state of being necessary, unavoidable, or absolutely requisite.)  [necessity]\nمثال: 今日の世界は食料生産を促進する必要性がある。\n→ The world today needs to advance its production of food.",
 "ひつようとする": "حَاجَة, ضَرُورَة (A requirement for something; something needed.) / اِحْتَاجَ (To have an absolute requirement for.) / اِحْتَاجَ (To want strongly; to feel that one must have something.)  [to need]\nمثال: とりわけ子供たちは愛情を必要とする。\n→ Above all, children need love.",
