 "ひとびと": "نَاس, خَلْق (plural of person: a body of persons considered generally or collectively; a grou) / خَلْق, شَعْب (Persons forming or belonging to a particular group, such as a nation, class, eth) / أَهْل (A person's ancestors, relatives or family.) / شَعْب (The mass of a community as distinguished from a special class (elite); the commo)  [people]\nمثال: 以前は、人々は歩いて旅をしたものだった。\n→ People used to travel on foot. / اَلْجَمِيع, كُلّ شَخْص (Every individual in a set; all people.)  [everybody]\nمثال: 人々はみな彼の英雄的行為をたたえた。\n→ Everybody praised his heroism.",
