 "ひとふろ": "حَمَّام, مُغْسَل (A tub or pool which is used for bathing: bathtub.) / حَمَّام, مُغْتَسَل (A building or area where bathing occurs.) / اِسْتِحْمَام, اِغْتِسَال (The act of bathing; an instance of this; the taking of a bath.)  [(taking) a bath]\nمثال: 一風呂浴びてさっぱりした。\n→ I feel quite refreshed after taking a bath.",
