 "ひと時": "مُدَّة (uncertain duration of time, a period of time) / فَتْرَة (uncertain duration of time, a period of time) / فِي حِين, بَيْنَمَا (During the same time that.)  [a while]\nمثال: 私達は海岸ですばらしいひとときを過ごした。\n→ We had a glorious time at the seaside. / نُقْطَة, عَلَامَة فَصْلِيَّة (The punctuation mark “.” (indicating the ending of a sentence or marking an abbr) / حِصَّةٌ (Each of the divisions into which a school day is split, allocated to a given sub) / عَصْر (A geochronologic unit of millions to tens of millions of years; a subdivision of)  [a period] / [two-hour period]",
