 "ひびき": "صَدًى (A reflected sound that is heard again by its initial observer.)  [echo] / سليم (Healthy.) / صَوْت, صوت (A sensation perceived by the ear caused by the vibration of air or some other me) / صَوَّتَ, طَلَّع صوت (To produce a sound.)  [sound (esp. the distinctive sound of an object or activity, e.g. rain, gun, gallop, drum)] / [quality of a sound (e.g. a fine phrase, clear voice, resonant bell) ; feeling of a sound]\nمثال: その手紙には強制的なひびきがあるし、さらに悪いことには、思いやりがない。\n→ The letter sounds forced, what is worse, insincere.",
