 "ひらく": "مَفْتُوح (Able to be used or interacted with in some way.) / فَتَحَ (to make something accessible) / فتح (to make something accessible) / حل (to make something accessible) / فتح (to make something accessible) / اِنْفَتَحَ (to become open)  [to open]\nمثال: 先週、私達は舞踏会を開きました。\n→ We gave a ball last week. / تَفَرَّقَ (Become further apart.) / فَرَّقَ (To place items further apart.) / مُنْتَشِر, مُتَفَرِّق (Far apart, not close to each other, extended over an expanse of space or time.)  [to spread out]\nمثال: 庭のバラの木のつぼみが少しずつ開き始める。\n→ Little by little, the buds on the rosebush in my garden begin to open. / مَفْتُوح (Able to be used or interacted with in some way.) / فَتَحَ (to make something accessible) / فتح (to make something accessible) / حل (to make something accessible) / فتح (to make something accessible) / اِنْفَتَحَ (to become open)  [to open (for business, e.g. in the morning)] / [to be wide (gap, etc.) ; to widen]",
 "ひらけ": "بِدَايَة (The act of doing that which begins anything; commencement of an action, state, o) / بِدَايَة (That which begins or originates something; the source or first cause.) / بِدَايَة (The initial portion of some extended thing.)  [beginning] / حَضَارَة, تَمَدُّن (An organized culture encompassing many communities, often on the scale of a nati) / تَثْقِيف (The act or process of civilizing or becoming civilized.)  [civilization]",
 "ひらけずり": "مِسْحَاج, مِنْجَرَة (A tool for smoothing wood by removing thin layers from the surface.) / سَحَجَ (To smooth (wood) with a plane.) / طَائِرَة, طَيَّارَة (An airplane; an aeroplane.) / دُلْب, صِنَار (A deciduous tree of the genus Platanus.)  [planing (of a surface)]",
 "ひらける": "تَفَرَّقَ (Become further apart.) / فَرَّقَ (To place items further apart.) / مُنْتَشِر, مُتَفَرِّق (Far apart, not close to each other, extended over an expanse of space or time.)  [to spread out] / حَسَّنَ (To make (something) better; to increase the value or productivity (of something)) / تَحَسَّنَ (To become better.)  [to improve (of luck, prospects, etc.)]\nمثال: そうすればやがて運が開けるでしょう。\n→ And soon your luck will turn for the better. / طَوَّرَ (To progress through a sequence of stages.)  [to develop (of a town, civilization, etc.)] / [to be sensible ; to be understanding]",
 "ひらたい": "مُسَطَّح (having no variations in altitude)  [flat]\nمثال: 古代人たちは地球は平たいと信じていた。\n→ The ancients believed the earth was flat. / بَسِيط (Simple, unaltered.) / سَهْل (An expanse of land with relatively low relief and few trees, especially a grassy)  [plain (language, words, etc.)]\nusu. as 平たく言えば, 平たく言うと, etc.",
