 "ひらづめ": "ظُفْر, ضفر (The horny plate or appendage at the ends of the digits of various animals, inclu) / مِسْمَار, مسمار (A spike-shaped metal fastener used for joining wood or similar materials. The na)  [nail (e.g. fingernail, toenail)]",
 "ひらて": "رَاحَة, كَفّ (The inner and somewhat concave part of the human hand or other primate hand that)  [palm]\nمثال: 昔は、悪いことをすると、学校の先生から平手をくらったり拳固をもらうことが当たり前だった。\n→ In the past it was perfectly normal to get the back of a teacher's hand or fist as punishment. / [playing on equal terms ; lack of handicap]",
 "ひらてうち": "صَفْعَة, لَطْمَة (A blow, especially one given with the open hand, or with something broad and fla) / صَفَعَ (to give a slap) / لَطَمَ (to give a slap)  [slap]\nمثال: その子はお行儀悪くして母親に平手打ちされた。\n→ That kid got a slap from his mother for being rude.",
