 "ひらなべ": "مِقْلَاة (flat vessel used for cooking — see also frying pan) / ينتقد بشدَة (To disparage; to belittle; to put down; to harshly criticize, especially a work )  [pan]\nمثال: 平なべを火からおろしなさい。\n→ Take the pan off the fire.",
 "ひらに": "أَرْضَى, أَعْجَبَ (To make happy or satisfy; to give pleasure to.) / مِن فَضْلِك (interjection to make a polite request) / رَجَاءً (interjection to make a polite request) / لَو سَمَحْت (interjection to make a polite request) / لُطْفًا (interjection to make a polite request) / أَرْجُوك (interjection to make a polite request)  [please (e.g. forgive me)]\nusu. followed by a request\nمثال: どうかひらにご容赦ください。\n→ Please accept my humble apologies.",
 "ひらひら": "لَوَّحَ, رَفْرَفَ (To move one's hand back and forth (generally above the shoulders) in greeting or) / مَوْج, مَوْجَة (A moving disturbance in the level of a body of liquid; an undulation.)  [waving]\nمثال: 風が吹くたびに、桜の花びらが、ひらひらと舞い降りてました。\n→ The cherry blossoms flutter down whenever the wind blows. / وَمِيض, وَمْضَة (An unsteady flash of light.) / طَرْفَة, وَمْضَة (A short moment.) / رَفْرَفَ, خفَقَ (To burn or shine unsteadily, or with a wavering light.)  [flickering (light, flame, etc.)] / [frill ; piece of thin material]",
 "ひらび": "يَوْم عَمَل (day of the week, excluding weekends)  [weekday]\nمثال: 平日料金と休日料金で、１万円も違うんだ。\n→ You have to pay 10,000 yen extra on holidays. / [kanji radical 73]",
