 "ひらめき": "البَرْق (Any of various DC Comics superheroes who have the power of superspeed, derived f)  [flash]\nمثال: 私は遠くに稲妻のひらめきを見た。\n→ I saw flashes of lightning in the distance. / نظرة ثاقبة (A sight or view of the interior of anything; a deep inspection or view; introspe)  [insight]\nمثال: アジアの宗教から閃きを得て、彼は複数の素晴らしい彫刻を生み出した。\n→ Asian religions inspire him to create splendid sculptures. / لَوَّحَ, رَفْرَفَ (To move one's hand back and forth (generally above the shoulders) in greeting or) / مَوْج, مَوْجَة (A moving disturbance in the level of a body of liquid; an undulation.)  [waving (e.g. of a flag in the wind)]",
 "ひらめく": "البَرْق (Any of various DC Comics superheroes who have the power of superspeed, derived f)  [to flash (e.g. lightning)] / لَوَّحَ, رَفْرَفَ (To move one's hand back and forth (generally above the shoulders) in greeting or) / مَوْج, مَوْجَة (A moving disturbance in the level of a body of liquid; an undulation.)  [to wave] / [to flash into one's mind (e.g. an idea) ; to come to one suddenly]\nمثال: 素晴らしい考えがひらめいた。\n→ A wonderful idea just ran through my mind.",
