 "ひりつ": "نِسْبَة (A number representing a comparison between two named things.)  [ratio]\nمثال: 親に対する子どもの比率が大きくなればなるほど子どもを育てるのは難しくなる。\n→ The higher the ratio of children to parents, the harder it is to bring up the children.",
