 "ふらつき": "تَرَنُّح (An unsteady movement of the body in walking or standing as if one were about to ) / تَرَنَّحَ (To sway unsteadily, reel, or totter.)  [staggering]",
 "ふらつく": "تَرَنُّح (An unsteady movement of the body in walking or standing as if one were about to ) / تَرَنَّحَ (To sway unsteadily, reel, or totter.)  [to stagger]\nمثال: 酒を飲みすぎて足もとがふらついた。\n→ I drank too much and was unsteady on my feet. / [to be unfixed (emotions, beliefs, etc.) ; to waver] / [to wander aimlessly ; to loiter]",
