 "ふりはば": "[amplitude (of vibration)]\nمثال: 周波数の平均値は振幅の増大にしたがって減じる。\n→ The mean value of the frequency decreases with increasing amplitude. / تَذَبذُب, تَقَلُّب (A wavering; unsteadiness.)  [fluctuation]",
 "ふりはらう": "اِنْتَفَضَ (To remove (something attached to, on or clinging to an object) by shaking.)  [to shake off]\nمثال: 私は彼の手を振り払うことができませんでした。\n→ I couldn't shake off his hand.",
