 "ぷつっ": "[(breaking) with a snap (of a thread, rope, etc.)] / فَجْأَةً (Happening quickly and with little or no warning; in a sudden manner.)  [(ending) suddenly (of a call, communications, etc.)] / [breaking out (of a pimple, swelling, etc.)] / زُبّ, زُبْر (The penis.)  [pricking (e.g. with a needle)]",
 "ぷつり": "[(breaking) with a snap (of a thread, string, etc.)] / فَجْأَةً (Happening quickly and with little or no warning; in a sudden manner.)  [(ending) suddenly (of a call, communications, etc.)] / ثَقَبَ (To puncture; to break through.) / ثَقَبَ (To create a hole in the skin for the purpose of inserting jewelry.)  [piercing (e.g. with a needle)] / [squashing (something small; e.g. an insect)]",
