 "べいこくみん": "أَمْرِيكِيّ, أَمْرِيكِيَّة (The dialect of English spoken in and around the contiguous United States of Amer)  [American (citizen)]\nمثال: 大統領や知事が立派に合法的に行動した場合には、米国民は彼らを再選し、彼らが属する政党に指示を送ることによって承認を表明する。\n→ When a president or a governor acts wisely and lawfully, Americans express their approval by reelecting him and by supporting his political…",
 "べいご": "اَلْإِنْجِلِيزِيَّة اَلْأَمْرِيكِيَّة (The form of the English language that is chiefly used in the United States, cont)  [American English]",
 "べいごま": "دُوَّامَة, بُلْبُل (A toy with a tapering point that can be made to spin on its axis, either with a )  [spinning top (traditionally made of Japanese Babylon shell)]",
 "べいしきしゅうきゅう": "كُرَة الْقَدَم الْأَمْرِيكِيَّة, الكُرة الأَمْرِيكِيّة (The ball used to play the sport of American football.)  [American football]",
 "べいしゅう": "أَمْرِيكَا, أَمِيرِكَا (A supercontinent consisting of North America, Central America and South America )  [the Americas]",
 "べいじゅう": "رَافَقَ (To go with or attend as a companion or associate; to keep company with; to go al) / صَاحَبَ, رَافَقَ (To perform an accompanying part or parts in a composition.) / رَافَقَ (To associate in a company; to keep company.)  [accompanying]",
 "べいじん": "أَمْرِيكِيّ, أَمْرِيكِيَّة (The dialect of English spoken in and around the contiguous United States of Amer)  [American (person)]",
 "べいばく": "غَلَّة (A single seed of a food crop, especially a cereal grass crop.)  [corn]",
 "べいふん": "دَقِيق الْأَرُزّ, أَرُزّ مَسْحُوق (Flour milled from rice.)  [rice flour]",
 "べいドル": "دُولَار أَمْرِيكِيّ (The official currency of the United States.)  [US dollar]\nمثال: 日本の通貨は米ドルに対しこの１年で２５％強くなった。\n→ The Japanese currency has appreciated against the U.S. dollar by more than 25% over the past year.",
 "べえごま": "دُوَّامَة, بُلْبُل (A toy with a tapering point that can be made to spin on its axis, either with a )  [spinning top (traditionally made of Japanese Babylon shell)]",
 "べからざる": "عَجَزَ, لَا يَسْتَطِيع (Can not; be unable to (whether due to physical inability, logical impossibility,)  [cannot]\nمثال: 実際にこれらの目標を実現するのに欠くべからざる役割を果たしてきた。\n→ These bodies have actually played indispensable roles in attaining these goals.",
 "べからず": "[must not (do) ; should not]\nat sentence end\nمثال: 公園の掲示に「芝生に入るべからず」と書いてあった。\n→ The notice in the park said, \"Keep off the grass.\" / عَجَزَ, لَا يَسْتَطِيع (Can not; be unable to (whether due to physical inability, logical impossibility,)  [cannot]",
 "べかりけり": "يَنْبَغِي أَنْ (expressing obligation) / مِنْ اَلْمَفْرُوض أَنْ (expressing obligation) / مِنْ اَلْمُفْتَرَض أَنْ (expressing obligation)  [should]",
 "べき": "يَنْبَغِي أَنْ (expressing obligation) / مِنْ اَلْمَفْرُوض أَنْ (expressing obligation) / مِنْ اَلْمُفْتَرَض أَنْ (expressing obligation)  [should]\nafter the dictionary form of a verb\nمثال: あなたにはまず最初に尋ねるべきだったでしょうか。\n→ Should I have asked you first?",
 "べきこん": "جَذْريّ (Of or pertaining to the root of a plant.) / رَادِيكَالِيّ (A person with radical opinions.)  [radical]",
 "べきしすう": "أُسّ (The number by which a value (called the base) is said to be raised to a power in)  [exponent]",
 "べきじょう": "قُوَّة, قُدْرَة (The ability to coerce, influence, or control.) / قُوَّة (The ability to coerce, influence, or control.) / قُوَّة, طَاقَة (Strength, energy.) / طَاقَة كَهْرَبَائِيَّة, طَاقَة (Strength, energy.) / قُوَّة (A product of equal factors (and generalizations of this notion): xⁿ, read as \"x )  [power]",
 "べきすう": "أُسّ (The number by which a value (called the base) is said to be raised to a power in)  [exponent]",
 "べき乗": "قُوَّة, قُدْرَة (The ability to coerce, influence, or control.) / قُوَّة (The ability to coerce, influence, or control.) / قُوَّة, طَاقَة (Strength, energy.) / طَاقَة كَهْرَبَائِيَّة, طَاقَة (Strength, energy.) / قُوَّة (A product of equal factors (and generalizations of this notion): xⁿ, read as \"x )  [power]",
 "べき指数": "أُسّ (The number by which a value (called the base) is said to be raised to a power in)  [exponent]",
 "べき根": "جَذْريّ (Of or pertaining to the root of a plant.) / رَادِيكَالِيّ (A person with radical opinions.)  [radical]",
 "べく": "لِكَي, لِ (before an infinitive: As a means of achieving the specified end; to.)  [in order to] / وَجَبَ, يَتَحَتَّم (To do as a requirement; indicates that the sentence subject is required as an im) / لَابُدَّ (Used to indicate that something is very likely, probable, or certain to be true.) / عَصِير (Fruit juice that will ferment or has fermented, usually from grapes.)  [must]\nمثال: 書籍が学問に従うべく、学問が書籍に従うべからず。\n→ Books must follow sciences, and not sciences books.",
 "べこ": "بَقَرَة, بقرة (An adult female of the species Bos taurus, especially one that has calved.) / بَقَرَة, بَقَر (Any member of the species Bos taurus that is not of a bucking breed or fighting )  [cow]",
 "べこべこ": "إِبْزِيم (metal clasp with a hinged tongue or a spike)  [buckling] / سَجَدَ, تَمَلَّقَ (To kneel and bow low enough to touch one’s forehead to the ground.)  [kowtowing]",
 "べし": "وَجَبَ, يَتَحَتَّم (To do as a requirement; indicates that the sentence subject is required as an im) / لَابُدَّ (Used to indicate that something is very likely, probable, or certain to be true.) / عَصِير (Fruit juice that will ferment or has fermented, usually from grapes.)  [must]\nمثال: 各会員は会費を払うべし。\n→ Each member has to pay a membership fee. / إرَادَة (One's independent faculty of choice; the ability to be able to exercise one's ch) / رَغْبَة, إرَادَة (The act of choosing to do something; a person’s conscious intent or volition.) / إرَادَة (One's intention or decision; someone's orders or commands.)  [will (surely)] / إرَادَة (One's independent faculty of choice; the ability to be able to exercise one's ch) / رَغْبَة, إرَادَة (The act of choosing to do something; a person’s conscious intent or volition.) / إرَادَة (One's intention or decision; someone's orders or commands.)  [will (do)]\nindicates volition",
 "べた": "جَمِيع أَنْحَاء, كُلّ (Everywhere; covering completely.)  [all over]\nusu. adverbially as 〜に / اِنْتَهَى, أَكْمَلَ (To finish; to make done; to reach the end.) / كَامِل (With all parts included; with nothing missing; full.) / ذَرِيع (Generic intensifier.)  [complete]\nbefore a noun / ثَقِيل الظَِلّ, سَخِيف (Hackneyed or excessively sentimental.)  [corny]\nمثال: ＯＫが出たので、思わずグラスランナーのシーフ・バードというベタなキャラを作っちゃいましたよ。\n→ I got the OK so I unthinkingly created the clichéd 'grass runner thief/bard' character. / [plaintext]",
 "べたっと": "مَعًا, سَوِيًّا (At the same time, in the same place; in close association or proximity.)  [(stuck) together] / تَحْتَ, تَحْت (From a higher position to a lower one; downwards.) / حَتَى, إِلَى (From one end to another of (in any direction); along.) / سقط (to drop) / زَغَب (Soft, fluffy immature feathers which grow on young birds. Used as insulating mat) / زَغَب (The pubescence of plants; the hairy crown or envelope of the seeds of certain pl) / زَغَب (The soft hair of the face when beginning to appear.)  [(flopping) down]",
 "べたべた": "[sticky] / [thickly (e.g. painted) ; heavily (applied)] / جَمِيع أَنْحَاء, كُلّ (Everywhere; covering completely.)  [all over (pasting, stamping, etc.)]\nمثال: 彼は壁一面にポスターをべたべた張った。\n→ He plastered the wall with posters. / تَمَسَّكَ (To hold very tightly, as to not fall off.)  [clinging (e.g. of a person)]\nمثال: お前が近くにいるのをいいことにベタベタしやがって！！\n→ What the fuck are you up to taking advantage of his proximity to cling to him like a wet T-shirt?!",
 "べち": "تَمْيِيْز (The act of distinguishing, discriminating; discrimination.)  [distinction] / فَصَلَ (To disunite from a group or mass; to disconnect.) / مُنْفَصِل (Apart from (the rest); not connected to or attached to (anything else).)  [separate]\nمثال: また別のときにチェスをしましょう。\n→ Let's play chess another time. / اِسْتِثْنَاء (The act of excepting or excluding; exclusion; restriction by taking out somethin) / اِسْتِثْنَاء, خَطَأ (An interruption in normal processing, typically caused by an error condition, th)  [exception]\noft. as 別として / طِبْقًا لِـ, وَفْقًا لِـ (Based on what is said or stated by; on the authority of; by the order of.) / بِالنِّسْبَة لِـ (In a manner conforming or corresponding to; in proportion to; in accordance with)  [according to]\nمثال: これらの本を主題別に分類してください。\n→ Please classify these books by subject.",
 "べちだん": "خاص (Forming a part of a genus; relatively limited in extension; affirmed or denied o)  [particular] / خُصُوصًا, خَاصَّةً (Particularly; to a greater extent than is normal.)  [(not) especially]\nusu. before a verb in negative form",
 "べちゃべちゃ": "هَذَى (To talk idly.)  [chattering]",
 "べちょべちょ": "هَذَى (To talk idly.)  [chattering]",
 "べっかく": "خَاصّ, خُصُوصِيّ (Distinguished by a unique, particular, or unusual quality.)  [special]\nمثال: コックとして彼は別格だ。\n→ As a cook he is in a class by himself.",
 "べっかん": "تَمْدِيد (An exercise in which an arm or leg is straightened against resistance.)  [extension]\nمثال: 別館は本館の北側にある。\n→ The annex is on the north of the original building.",
 "べっき": "خَاتِمَة (an epilogue.)  [afterword]",
 "べっきょ": "تَفْرِقَة (The act of disuniting two or more things, or the condition of being separated.)  [separation]\nمثال: 彼は両親と別居している。\n→ He lives apart from his parents."
